  "question": {
    "text": "A plane electromagnetic wave of frequency <math><mn>25</mn><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math> is propagating in vacuum along the z-direction. At a particular point in space and time, the magnetic filed is given by <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The corresponding electric field <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is (speed of light <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> )"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1.66</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfrac><mrow><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></math>",
